  12 | fn bad_fixture(x: Bool | Int | Float | Str, a: Bool | Int | Float | Str, b: Bool | Int | Float | Str, c: Bool | Int | Float | Str, d: Bool | Int | Float | Str) -> Int {
     |    ^^^^^^^^^^^ too many forms to check
     |
     = help: fewer parameters of several types, or a list where the function needs many values

## a_name_that_is_no_type
the Zeff source of core::bad_fixture does not build:
  error[Z0101]: no type is called `Int | Number`
   --> core/functions/bad_fixture.zeff:8:19
    |
  8 | fn bad_fixture(x: Int | Number) -> Int {
    |                   ^^^^^^^^^^^^ not a type
